IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRAUD.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 N PIC 99.
01 I PIC 99.
01 ACTUAL PIC X(5).
01 PREDICT PIC X(5).

01 TP PIC 999 VALUE 0.
01 FP PIC 999 VALUE 0.
01 TN PIC 999 VALUE 0.
01 FN PIC 999 VALUE 0.

01 P PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.
01 R PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.
01 DEN PIC 999.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT N

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL I > N

        ACCEPT ACTUAL
        ACCEPT PREDICT

        IF ACTUAL = "FRAUD"
            IF PREDICT = "FLAG"
                ADD 1 TO TP
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO FN
            END-IF
        ELSE
            IF PREDICT = "FLAG"
                ADD 1 TO FP
            ELSE
                ADD 1 TO TN
            END-IF
        END-IF

    END-PERFORM

    COMPUTE DEN = TP + FP
    IF DEN > 0
        COMPUTE P ROUNDED = TP / DEN
    END-IF

    COMPUTE DEN = TP + FN
    IF DEN > 0
        COMPUTE R ROUNDED = TP / DEN
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "TP = " TP
    DISPLAY "FP = " FP
    DISPLAY "TN = " TN
    DISPLAY "FN = " FN
    DISPLAY "Precision = " P
    DISPLAY "Recall = " R

    STOP RUN.